                                "sense_id": "4fb81bd2-bd53-3f2c-b5b6-0e92d3c24591",
                                "text": "Alicent’s crew intercede and try to grab the prince for themselves, Aemond restraining his fleeing brother while Criston crosses swords with Cargyll 1. That’s when Cargyll 2 moonwalks away, realizing that he wants no part of this royal shitshow."
